Qwen3.5-0.8B QNN NPU runtime for the Quectel PI H1 (QCS6490)
NOTICE -- attribution, provenance and modification statement
============================================================

This Yocto recipe (qwen35-npu) packages a third-party Apache-2.0 runtime plus
pre-compiled model assets published by a third party. It is a repackaging and
integration effort, not an original port. The license text is in LICENSE, next
to this file, and in /usr/share/doc/qwen35-npu/ on the installed system.

1. Runtime and native engine
----------------------------
The Python runtime (runtime/2k/*.py) and the C++ native engine
(native/2k/qwen_text_engine.cpp, native/2k/qnn_memory.cpp and headers) come
from the Radxa Dragon Q6A port of Qwen3.5-0.8B:

  Fork used for the integration
    https://github.com/super617/radxa-dragon-q6a-qwen3.5-0.8b-qcs6490-qnn-npu
    commit 97650f6ed3a1178dcf1ff761d95e4523819bfe08

  Original upstream project
    https://github.com/PrismPhi/radxa-dragon-q6a-qwen3.5-0.8b-qcs6490-qnn-npu
    release v0.1.0-rc1

  License: Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE). Copyright and attribution belong to the
  upstream authors; this repository claims no authorship of that code.

The ONNX Runtime API headers bundled with our native engine
(files/native/ort_include/*.h) are five unmodified headers from
microsoft/onnxruntime v1.27.0 (tag v1.27.0, commit 8f0278c) and remain under the
MIT license, with their original file notices intact.

2. Pre-compiled NPU model assets
--------------------------------
The compiled QNN EPContext graphs, the tensor contracts and the shared assets
(embedding table, tokenizer) are downloaded at build time, unchanged, from:

  HuggingFace  PrismPhi/Qwen3.5-0.8B-Radxa-Dragon-Q6A-QCS6490-QNN-NPU
  revision     05de67d2f33c0cb83e375f13788895c761d30b1e

They are pinned per file by SHA-256 in the recipe (SRC_URI[...sha256sum]); no
file is modified, re-quantized or re-compiled by this integration. Distributed
under the terms of the upstream Apache-2.0 release; keep this NOTICE and
LICENSE with any redistribution.

Only the 2K group is installed: common/, models/2k/ and contracts/2k/. The 4K
group and the Vision contexts are intentionally not shipped.

3. Base model
-------------
The assets above are derivatives of the Qwen3.5-0.8B checkpoint:

  Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B, revision 2fc06364715b967f1860aea9cf38778875588b17
  Copyright (c) Alibaba Cloud / Qwen team. Licensed under Apache-2.0.
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B

The distributed derivatives include a fixed-shape ONNX export, post-training
quantization, device-specific numerical corrections, graph layout
transformations, context extension and QNN EPContext compilation, all performed
by the upstream project, not by this integration.

